title: "Compute-Constrained Road Damage Detection across Geographic and Sensor Domains"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-09-03
abstract: >-
  A reproducible CPU-only YOLO11n baseline for road damage detection on
  RDD2022, with domain-aware data splitting, COCO evaluation, inference
  utilities, safe model serialization, and an accompanying IEEE paper.
